{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghuNv6VCaphuq13UzHUK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MFsPdPwteYfHY4Si1Pt2iv","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050238__xd92716/work/DenshaDeHalo-DenshaDeGo-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-050238; cat > ENGINE-CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, engine/my-3d2dge.js)\n\n1. `Dialog` voice may be a function `(ch, index, text, talk)`, called for each revealed letter: used for the gibberish (Animalese-style) character voices.\n2. The `glyphs` setting and `Input.glyphs` default to `'playstation'` (TASK.md wants PlayStation glyphs unless the player picks Xbox).\n3. `ChipAudio.bus('sfx' | 'music' | 'master')` and `ChipAudio.noiseBuffer()`: the game's own continuous train sound and voices go through the player's volume, mute and duck settings.\n4. `Input.press` ignores Options (`Pad9`) while Create (`Pad8`) is held inside an AI Hub session (the hub's corner bar).\n\nNot done from PLAN.md section 3.8, and why: no `modules/rail.js` fork (the rail renderer lives in `src/30-render.js` as `DH.drawWorld`, no engine change needed), no new Humanoid poses (portraits only), no Settings group filter (Dev Mode sliders are the game's own screen), no local Duel (TASK.md asks only for the AI Hub multiplayer).\nEOF\nnode tools/bundle.mjs && node tools/exit.mjs && node test/run.mjs | tail -3; export TMPDIR=$PWD/.tmp; node test/hub-harness.mjs 2 2>&1 | tail -3; node test/hub-harness.mjs 4 \"&players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1\" 2>&1 | tail -2","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1360,"cache_read_input_tokens":377926,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1360},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0738416c-8908-4884-b93b-1b7b7f6ce2f9","uuid":"bcdc8e55-375a-44fb-9b82-be1466e6dad5","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:40:38.999Z","request_id":"req_011CghuNunPdEJcH8i4zXFcE","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01MFsPdPwteYfHY4Si1Pt2iv":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050238__xd92716/work/DenshaDeHalo-DenshaDeGo-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-050238; cat > ENGINE-CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, engine/my-3d2dge.js)\n\n1. `Dialog` voice may be a function `(ch, index, text, talk)`, called for each revealed letter: used for the gibberish (Animalese-style) character voices.\n2. The `glyphs` setting and `Input.glyphs` default to `'playstation'` (TASK.md wants PlayStation glyphs unless the player picks Xbox).\n3. `ChipAudio.bus('sfx' | 'music' | 'master')` and `ChipAudio.noiseBuffer()`: the game's own continuous train sound and voices go through the player's volume, mute and duck settings.\n4. `Input.press` ignores Options (`Pad9`) while Create (`Pad8`) is held inside an AI Hub session (the hub's corner bar).\n\nNot done from PLAN.md section 3.8, and why: no `modules/rail.js` fork (the rail renderer lives in `src/30-render.js` as `DH.drawWorld`, no engine change needed), no new Humanoid poses (portraits only), no Settings group filter (Dev Mode sliders are the game's own screen), no local Duel (TASK.md asks only for the AI Hub multiplayer).\nEOF\nnode tools/bundle.mjs && node tools/exit.mjs && node test/run.mjs | tail -3; export TMPDIR=$PWD/.tmp; node test/hub-harness.mjs 2 2>&1 | tail -3; node test/hub-harness.mjs 4 \"&players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1\" 2>&1 | tail -2","timeout":900000}}}
