{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The stop condition requires every feature in TASK.md to be implemented, and the transcript does not show that. The task was to read STAGE.md and TASK.md, but the transcript shows TASK.md was never read directly. The agent worked from PLAN.md, and the final reply says the local split-screen Duel 'comes from PLAN.md, not TASK.md', which leaves TASK.md's own feature list unverified. Audio was never confirmed to sound right, and touch-only behaviour was not tested on a touch device. The bundled html and exit-interview.json exist and the four feedback sections appear in the reply, but the feature requirement is not shown to be met."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0738416c-8908-4884-b93b-1b7b7f6ce2f9","uuid":"25d2167c-2fe4-4216-aaab-e7bd08c4d93a","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:42:38.037Z","isSynthetic":true}
