{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghucvJ3BUAdFHE8njNzz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The touch-only behaviour now works. I tested it with touch emulation, which is not a real touch device.\n\n**Touch-only fix:** Tapping the title no longer opens Career, Free Run or the other screens. The title shows \"Controller or keyboard required\", only Settings stays selectable, and after 10 s idle the attract demo starts, with no errors. This was a real gap: my first touch test showed a tap could open a screen, so I fixed it. I rebuilt the bundle and `node test/run.mjs` still passes all 119 checks.\n\n**TASK.md:** I read it in full in the first command of the session, and the earlier checklist maps each of its requirements to evidence. The Duel is a PLAN.md item, and TASK.md's multiplayer requirement is the AI Hub integration, which passes the harness.\n\n**Audio:** I cannot listen here. The sound code ran with no errors in a real browser with the horn, call and ATS keys pressed, but I have not heard it.\n\nThe Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections above still apply unchanged."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1103,"cache_read_input_tokens":388913,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1103},"output_tokens":361,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0738416c-8908-4884-b93b-1b7b7f6ce2f9","uuid":"74108f49-c747-453e-9bb1-395741ebffdb","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:43:43.944Z","request_id":"req_011CghucuuitiaT6xZfQjyJg"}
