{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghujAAsvjUdrT7xmfhHL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two of the open items are now closed on the final bundle. I'd call the feature requirement met, except for two limits I can't remove: I can't listen to the audio, and the local Duel was not built.\n\n- **Hub harness:** I reran it on the final bundle, with the touch-only fix included. It passed for 2 players, for 4 players with 150 ms latency and 5% loss, for 4 players with the host leaving, and for 1 player. There were no page errors.\n- **Audio:** I measured the master output with an analyser while the autopilot drove. It is audible and varies over time (RMS between 0.006 and 0.039), and the page had no errors. I still can't judge how it sounds by ear.\n- **Touch-only:** I tested it with touch emulation, not a real touch device. The title shows \"Controller or keyboard required\", only Settings stays selectable, and the attract demo starts after 10 s idle.\n- **Duel:** The local split-screen Duel was not built. It comes from PLAN.md, and TASK.md does not ask for it; its multiplayer requirement is the AI Hub integration, which passes.\n\nThe test suite (`node test/run.mjs`) passes all 119 checks. `exit-interview.json` was regenerated and parses. The bundle `DenshaDeHalo-DenshaDeGo-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-050238.html` is in the work folder root.\n\nThe four feedback sections are unchanged from my previous reply: Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback. The in-game About screen and `exit-interview.json` carry the same text."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1388,"cache_read_input_tokens":393808,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1388},"output_tokens":534,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"