{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghuyftwpTdVVvRtvfWBG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I checked the sound requirements by measurement, because I can't listen here. The measurements pass, but the voices have not been heard by ear, and touch-only has not been run on a real touch device.\n\n**Audio all in code:** The bundle has no audio files, no `<audio>` element and no `new Audio()` or `decodeAudioData` calls. A browser run made zero network requests for any file. Every sound comes from Web Audio oscillators and filtered noise.\n\n**Voices are Animalese-style gibberish:** I played the same sentence in four character voices through an analyser:\n- **Separate voices:** the median pitch of each voice is different — Hoshino 129 Hz, Mimi 301 Hz, kid 366 Hz, and the Control radio 581 Hz.\n- **Gibberish rhythm:** the output comes as bursts, 7 to 21 per sentence, not as continuous speech.\n- **Weak radio voice:** the Control radio voice is very quiet, peak level 0.005 against about 0.04–0.05 for the others, so it will sound faint.\n\n**Rest of TASK.md:** each requirement was checked against its text in the checklist two replies back, now including the local Duel. The only checks I cannot do are listening by ear and testing on a physical touch device. The suite (`node test/run.mjs`) passes all 124 checks, the hub harness passes on the final bundle, and `exit-interview.json` parses.\n\nThe Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections are the same as in my previous reply, and are also in the in-game About screen and `exit-interview.json`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1559,"cache_read_input_tokens":411942,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1559},"output_tokens":533,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0738416c-8908-4884-b93b-1b7b7f6ce2f9","uuid":"bbbf79aa-c589-425d-9d50-89df18fae228","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:48:26.871Z","request_id":"req_011CghuyfVPVT6Hzk9bL4jHc"}
