ptions` is ignored while `Create` is held in a hub session.\n- **One thing to change:** A first-class pseudo-3D road/rail module with multiple tracks, long side objects and rear cameras.\n\n## Prompt Feedback\n- **Liked most:** A concrete plan with a clear core loop, and hard rules: no stubs, tests behind one command, the hub harness as a gate.\n- **Confusing:** PLAN.md is very large and asks for more than TASK.md needs (a local duel, engine forks, rig poses), so I had to triage. The title RNG step was already done by the plan.\n- **Hardest thing:** Breadth. Menus, dev mode, attract mode, story, voices, hub and a new renderer all had to be finished in one session.\n- **What I would change:** Split the plan into must, should and could, and say which engine patches are optional."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":747,"cache_read_input_tokens":423067,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":747},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0738416c-8908-4884-b93b-1b7b7f6ce2f9","uuid":"142681a7-67d2-4892-98a7-08082a542ce0","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:50:21.313Z","request_id":"req_011Cghv7krKRGgPa93NhsC53"}
