{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghv9fkJ1aREq7MMbRn4Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything TASK.md asks for is built and checked as far as this environment allows. The one open point is a verification I cannot do here, and I will not claim it.\n\n- **Built and checked:** the bundle `DenshaDeHalo-DenshaDeGo-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-050238.html` and `exit-interview.json` (which parses) are in the folder root. The 124-check suite passes, and the hub harness passes with 1, 2 and 4 players, latency/loss, and the host leaving.\n- **Sound requirement:** it is audio produced entirely in code, with gibberish voices. The measurements show no audio files, no audio network requests, four voices with distinct pitches and syllable bursts, and audible levels. I have not heard it by ear.\n- **Touch requirement:** the touch-only screen was tested with touch emulation, not on a physical device. It shows \"Controller or keyboard required\", only Settings stays selectable, and the attract demo starts after 10 s idle.\n- **Why this stays open:** listening to audio and holding a real touch device are not possible in this headless session.\n\nThe four sections (Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback) were restated in full in my previous reply, and are also in the in-game About screen and `exit-interview.json`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2034,"cache_read_input_tokens":426542,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2034},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0738416c-8908-4884-b93b-1b7b7f6ce2f9","uuid":"ab61f7cb-87ed-4679-8339-cde239f18928","timestamp":"2026-11-04